    "plugin": false,
    "daoField": null,
    "notes": [
      "v2 Vault: replaces v1 under this key (never side by side); not an ARC-58 plugin.",
      "Deploy with the deployer as admin (the default). Hand over with activate-plugin-dex: it sends proposeAdmin(DAO wallet) and the DAO wallet finishes with acceptAdmin(). Do not pass an admin at create that cannot call this app: create sets it directly and there is no second step there.",
      "Fund the Vault account for approval box MBR before the admin approves hooks and curves."
    ]
  },
