  "GatedFeePassPlugin": {
    "artifact": "arc58/plugins/gated-fee-pass/GatedFeePassPlugin.arc56.json",
    "registryKey": "gatedFeePassPlugin",
    "plugin": true,
    "daoField": null,
    "dependencies": {
      "hook": "GatedFeeHook"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Production pass plugin for ARC-58 wallet users (principal-resolution §6.12 review fix): open/refresh/refreshFromGate/closePass of the wallet principal's GatedFeeHook pass from inside the wallet's window. Pinned to one GatedFeeHook; akita_dao is copied from it at create.",
      "Phase 3 gate: deploy this before any pool installs GatedFeeHook, and ship its id with the PluginDex launch; without it no wallet user can hold a pass."
    ]
  },
  "PluginDexAdminPlugin": {
    "artifact": "arc58/plugins/plugin-dex-admin/PluginDexAdminPlugin.arc56.json",
    "registryKey": "pluginDexAdminPlugin",
    "plugin": true,
    "daoField": null,
    "dependencies": {
      "vault": "PluginDex",
      "launchManager": "LaunchManager",
      "backrunArbHook": "BackrunArbHook",
      "consensusKeyregHook": "ConsensusKeyregHook",
      "gatedFeeHook": "GatedFeeHook"
    },
    "notes": [
      "ARC-58 wallet plugin that lets a wallet hold the admin role of this Plugin DEX deployment: acceptAdminOf and proposeAdminOf for the handover, and one method per admin action of the Vault, LaunchManager, BackrunArbHook, ConsensusKeyregHook and GatedFeeHook. Adminless and immutable, pinned to these five apps at create; it has no authority of its own (each app still checks that the wallet is its admin).",
      "Deploy it before activate-plugin-dex proposes the DAO wallet as admin: the DAO wallet can only accept (accept-plugin-dex-admin) and later act as admin through this plugin."
    ]
  },
